<title>SPAIN: Bloomberg in TV deal with Spain's news agency.</title>
<headline>Bloomberg in TV deal with Spain's news agency.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. financial news and information supplier Bloomberg L.P. and Spain's state news agency EFE signed an agreement on Tuesday which includes the production of a Spanish-language television news service.</p>
<p>The service will go live on April 1, 1997, EFE said.</p>
